WEBVTT

00:00:06.650 --> 00:00:10.150
The multiple powers contained 
in the triggerless tattoo

00:00:10.150 --> 00:00:13.410
correspond with the basic functions 
of the ruins' controls.

00:00:21.750 --> 00:00:25.420
In other words, Void Maker initializes,

00:00:25.420 --> 00:00:27.630
the healing power restores,

00:00:27.630 --> 00:00:30.260
and the tattoo sealing power shuts down.

00:00:36.180 --> 00:00:39.720
<i>You tell me at a time like this 
that I've overused my power?</i>

00:00:43.310 --> 00:00:47.060
And what's necessary to use 
the tattoo sealing power

00:00:47.060 --> 00:00:50.730
are high compatibility with Sealed, altruism,

00:00:50.730 --> 00:00:52.490
and a self-sacrificing spirit.

00:00:52.820 --> 00:00:56.280
The exact opposite of something 
as self-satisfying as vengeance.

00:00:57.660 --> 00:01:00.040
Are you telling me you're 
qualified to use it?!

00:01:00.450 --> 00:01:02.410
A self-centered person like you?!

00:01:03.790 --> 00:01:06.580
There is no one who loves this precious world

00:01:06.580 --> 00:01:08.540
and all the life within it as much as I do!

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:12.170
And it's for this love 
that mankind must die.

00:01:12.170 --> 00:01:14.720
It's for this love that 
humanity must be denied.

00:01:15.340 --> 00:01:18.140
The fictional tale of the ancient 
gods who created humans

00:01:18.140 --> 00:01:19.890
was only conceptual.

00:01:20.350 --> 00:01:23.390
They were merely an evil influence 
that locked the light

00:01:23.390 --> 00:01:26.850
of human intelligence in a dark 
cage and fed the flames of war.

00:01:27.190 --> 00:01:29.150
The creation of my god

00:01:29.520 --> 00:01:32.980
is the creation of potential that I 
offer to the world and its life.

00:01:32.980 --> 00:01:36.450
For that, I will gladly give my life

00:01:36.450 --> 00:01:39.240
as a sacrifice for the birth of that god.

00:01:40.530 --> 00:01:42.240
Can that even happen?

00:01:51.250 --> 00:01:54.300
You have Wiseman behind you, do you not?

00:01:54.630 --> 00:01:57.010
He should have known why you

00:01:57.010 --> 00:01:59.300
can't use the tattoo sealing power.

00:01:59.930 --> 00:02:01.600
<i>The wound won't close...</i>

00:02:01.600 --> 00:02:03.770
In other words, he never had

00:02:03.770 --> 00:02:06.180
any intention of letting you defeat me.

00:02:06.810 --> 00:02:09.060
Perhaps he intended to feed you to me...

00:02:09.350 --> 00:02:10.730
after filling you with poison.

00:02:11.230 --> 00:02:13.110
<i>Damn it... Why?</i>

00:02:13.610 --> 00:02:14.860
<i>Why can't I reach?</i>

00:02:20.660 --> 00:02:21.740
Seigi!

00:02:21.740 --> 00:02:22.780
Seigi-kun!

00:02:30.290 --> 00:02:34.250
The Deciding Battle

00:02:40.260 --> 00:02:41.510
Looks like it's time to quit.

00:02:41.510 --> 00:02:43.890
<i>Colonel, we'll rescue you right away!</i>

00:02:43.890 --> 00:02:45.140
<i>Please wait just a bit longer!</i>

00:02:45.140 --> 00:02:45.770
No need!

00:02:46.100 --> 00:02:48.270
Withdraw all troops immediately.

00:02:49.020 --> 00:02:50.730
Leave me and go.

00:02:52.020 --> 00:02:53.770
The healing power is dropping.

00:02:54.360 --> 00:02:55.650
It's at its limit.

00:02:56.650 --> 00:02:57.570
No...

00:02:58.240 --> 00:03:01.160
I have to be the one to defeat her.

00:03:01.450 --> 00:03:02.990
You've done enough, Seigi!

00:03:03.330 --> 00:03:04.660
You can't fight anymore!

00:03:05.370 --> 00:03:06.240
I have...

00:03:07.200 --> 00:03:09.460
to avenge Touko.

00:03:10.120 --> 00:03:11.460
I have to!

00:03:11.880 --> 00:03:14.090
I have to be the one to do it!

00:03:15.840 --> 00:03:17.380
Tom, Izzy.

00:03:18.010 --> 00:03:21.590
I'll buy us time. 
You take Seigi-kun and run.

00:03:24.800 --> 00:03:27.100
You can't handle it alone, Tamaki.

00:03:27.930 --> 00:03:30.520
Seigi, I'll get you home alive.

00:03:31.020 --> 00:03:32.770
You still have growing to do.

00:03:33.100 --> 00:03:34.560
You can get stronger.

00:03:35.320 --> 00:03:38.900
Don't get the wrong idea. 
I'm settling my own score.

00:03:39.400 --> 00:03:41.740
I'm not doing it for you, okay?

00:03:42.320 --> 00:03:44.570
Tom likes that kind of thing, you know.

00:03:44.570 --> 00:03:46.490
What do they call it? "Tsunderu"?

00:03:46.700 --> 00:03:48.330
Go on, get moving.

00:03:49.080 --> 00:03:50.000
Good luck.

00:03:50.330 --> 00:03:53.750
Don't. She's not an enemy 
you two can handle.

00:03:53.750 --> 00:03:55.170
You'll be killed!

00:03:58.840 --> 00:04:00.840
I'm showing you consideration.

00:04:01.130 --> 00:04:03.180
If you can run away, you should.

00:04:03.510 --> 00:04:07.010
I know what I said, but it'd make 
more sense to fight this one

00:04:07.010 --> 00:04:10.140
with mobile soldiers or 
generic humanoid weapons.

00:04:10.730 --> 00:04:12.640
Even a professional protagonist 
would struggle with this.

00:04:13.190 --> 00:04:14.940
You should've come better prepared, Tamaki.

00:04:15.270 --> 00:04:17.570
In just a few more minutes,

00:04:17.570 --> 00:04:19.940
the assimilated ruins 
will attach to my soul.

00:04:20.280 --> 00:04:22.570
When that happens, I will devour you both

00:04:22.570 --> 00:04:24.910
and leave no trace behind!

00:04:25.620 --> 00:04:27.780
You're ignoring orders!

00:04:28.280 --> 00:04:30.660
I told you I didn't need help!

00:04:30.910 --> 00:04:33.160
Colonel! Colonel Sanders!

00:04:33.830 --> 00:04:36.130
That voice... Tom?

00:04:40.380 --> 00:04:41.840
That would kill most people...

00:04:51.600 --> 00:04:52.520
Oh?

00:04:52.810 --> 00:04:55.100
You created a disparity in the air density

00:04:55.100 --> 00:04:56.810
to bend that light beam?

00:05:00.230 --> 00:05:02.570
I can do something similar to that.

00:05:14.120 --> 00:05:15.210
Is this a strong acid?!

00:05:16.920 --> 00:05:19.340
Tamaki! Throw me!

00:05:23.010 --> 00:05:25.340
Get there!

00:05:27.050 --> 00:05:28.340
Little fly...

00:05:31.390 --> 00:05:32.060
Izzy!

00:05:38.650 --> 00:05:41.940
Getting beaten all the time isn't my style!

00:05:59.290 --> 00:06:01.590
Izzy!

00:06:02.880 --> 00:06:04.960
I'm through going easy on you!

00:06:22.650 --> 00:06:24.400
The main camera's down!

00:06:24.400 --> 00:06:26.360
Put up the feed from the recon satellite!

00:06:41.880 --> 00:06:44.710
I see the princess at three o'clock!

00:06:44.710 --> 00:06:46.090
She's floating in the air!

00:06:46.340 --> 00:06:49.300
Colonel, we have to get away from here!

00:06:50.010 --> 00:06:51.930
Now that the princess has taken the ruins,

00:06:52.220 --> 00:06:55.310
we have to do whatever it takes to 
keep Seigi-kun, the key, alive!

00:06:55.810 --> 00:06:56.560
No.

00:06:56.850 --> 00:06:59.690
We're going to blow her away 
with a nuclear suicide bomb.

00:07:01.020 --> 00:07:02.230
What?!

00:07:02.520 --> 00:07:05.110
Also, why do you have the 
button to a nuclear bomb?

00:07:05.480 --> 00:07:07.360
This button's too big for

00:07:07.650 --> 00:07:09.740
our president's ass to handle.

00:07:10.070 --> 00:07:11.450
I can't trust him with it.

00:07:18.960 --> 00:07:20.420
Sorry, boys.

00:07:22.920 --> 00:07:24.590
Forgive me, Izzy!

00:07:24.590 --> 00:07:26.590
W-W-W-W-Wait!

00:07:26.590 --> 00:07:28.340
Please wait a minute, Colonel!

00:07:28.340 --> 00:07:30.090
If you do that, we'll die, too!

00:07:30.430 --> 00:07:33.390
Arya! This is the American way!

00:07:33.680 --> 00:07:37.060
I'll let you lick my ass in the afterlife!

00:07:54.410 --> 00:07:56.870
I'm a clown!

00:07:56.870 --> 00:07:58.870
Clown! Clown!

00:07:58.870 --> 00:08:02.830
Clown!

00:08:01.540 --> 00:08:05.460
Simply blowing everything up won't 
solve all your problems.

00:08:05.750 --> 00:08:08.630
You've seen too many 
Hollywood movies, Sanders.

00:08:17.890 --> 00:08:18.680
Seigi-kun!

00:08:28.020 --> 00:08:28.900
<i>No...</i>

00:08:29.860 --> 00:08:31.240
<i>No more.</i>

00:08:31.820 --> 00:08:34.700
<i>I don't want to lose anyone else!</i>

00:08:38.530 --> 00:08:40.660
I told you to live...

00:08:43.210 --> 00:08:46.290
You truly are... an idiot.

00:09:08.310 --> 00:09:09.320
<i>BB...</i>

00:09:09.650 --> 00:09:13.570
<i>In the end, you and I were both 
the same type of person.</i>

00:09:27.210 --> 00:09:28.710
<i>We can't protect anyone.</i>

00:09:28.920 --> 00:09:30.170
<i>We can't save anyone.</i>

00:09:30.750 --> 00:09:33.170
<i>All we do is watch people die.</i>

00:09:33.880 --> 00:09:36.300
<i>I don't have the right to carry 
the world on my shoulders.</i>

00:09:46.100 --> 00:09:48.690
<i>I'll deny myself.</i>

00:09:49.060 --> 00:09:51.440
<i>So let me give</i>

00:09:51.730 --> 00:09:54.530
<i>my own life to save Izzy!</i>

00:10:06.870 --> 00:10:07.870
The tattoo sealer?!

00:10:08.250 --> 00:10:09.880
He's alive?! What happened?!

00:10:11.000 --> 00:10:13.880
<i>I thought, if just one or two 
more people close to him died,</i>

00:10:14.170 --> 00:10:17.180
<i>he'd change the way he 
thought about things...</i>

00:10:18.260 --> 00:10:20.640
<i>He's handled things better than I thought.</i>

00:10:21.430 --> 00:10:23.140
<i>But in the end,</i>

00:10:23.430 --> 00:10:25.810
<i>I suppose I'll have to do this myself.</i>

00:10:44.410 --> 00:10:45.240
What is this?

00:10:45.540 --> 00:10:46.120
That's...

00:10:46.580 --> 00:10:48.080
The source is devouring me?

00:10:48.080 --> 00:10:50.540
No... Something's different!

00:10:51.000 --> 00:10:53.500
Wiseman, damn you!

00:10:54.920 --> 00:10:57.670
<i>If you thought I meant to give 
the poison to you directly,</i>

00:10:57.670 --> 00:11:00.220
<i>you're very wrong, Princess.</i>

00:11:09.520 --> 00:11:12.190
You've made two mistakes.

00:11:12.730 --> 00:11:13.610
First,

00:11:14.570 --> 00:11:17.070
you assumed that the source only consumes

00:11:17.070 --> 00:11:20.320
Sealed when they've burned out their souls.

00:11:20.860 --> 00:11:24.830
Second, you formed a link with him.

00:11:25.620 --> 00:11:27.200
In the dimension of tattoos,

00:11:27.200 --> 00:11:30.210
there are no one-sided links.

00:11:30.500 --> 00:11:34.040
You gave us an opening 
to take advantage of.

00:11:35.380 --> 00:11:37.670
I'm sure you realize now

00:11:39.590 --> 00:11:43.050
that your source's fuel 
is your sisters' souls.

00:11:43.340 --> 00:11:46.430
Bastard... You bastard!

00:11:54.360 --> 00:11:58.360
If we're up against a beast that's appeared 
from outside the bounds of reason,

00:11:58.900 --> 00:12:02.410
it's only logical to fight it 
with another of its own kind.

00:12:52.870 --> 00:12:55.000
The triggerless tattoo's source

00:12:55.000 --> 00:12:57.710
activates the tattoo 
sealer unconditionally,

00:12:58.170 --> 00:13:00.590
stripping you both of your void armor.

00:13:07.800 --> 00:13:11.060
What's left is two naked beasts 
trying to devour each other,

00:13:11.350 --> 00:13:13.390
a clash between two egos.

00:13:24.700 --> 00:13:26.990
<i>Tactical weaponry is no match for</i>

00:13:26.990 --> 00:13:29.240
<i>a massive source cloaked in void.</i>

00:13:29.830 --> 00:13:32.330
<i>At this point, there's nothing we can...</i>

00:13:33.290 --> 00:13:37.290
Seigi-kun! You're the only one 
who can fight the princess now!

00:13:37.750 --> 00:13:40.000
Please, protect us!

00:13:40.000 --> 00:13:41.210
Protect America!

00:13:41.210 --> 00:13:42.800
Protect our world!

00:13:57.190 --> 00:13:58.440
<i>That's not right.</i>

00:14:04.690 --> 00:14:05.990
<i>That's not right.</i>

00:14:10.990 --> 00:14:12.200
<i>That's wrong...</i>

00:14:12.540 --> 00:14:15.790
Seigi-kun! Protect the seven billion 
ideas of justice on this Earth!

00:14:23.460 --> 00:14:26.380
This is how you do it!

00:14:52.700 --> 00:14:53.780
Hey, Izzy.

00:14:54.620 --> 00:14:56.950
Looks like our souls were temporarily linked

00:14:56.950 --> 00:14:59.500
when you were swallowed up by Seigi's source.

00:14:59.870 --> 00:15:01.960
Damn that Wiseman...

00:15:05.170 --> 00:15:06.340
Blood!

00:15:13.800 --> 00:15:16.890
Thanks for opening his eyes.

00:15:17.100 --> 00:15:19.770
Y-Yeah...

00:15:21.980 --> 00:15:23.810
It'll all be over soon.

00:15:52.890 --> 00:15:55.430
Yes! He broke her mount!

00:15:57.600 --> 00:15:59.180
Thanks, Tom-san.

00:15:59.810 --> 00:16:01.270
I can see now.

00:16:07.900 --> 00:16:10.070
If she can control the source,

00:16:10.490 --> 00:16:13.490
that must mean she's using someone's 
soul besides mine to materialize it.

00:16:18.950 --> 00:16:21.870
It could only be the princess's sisters.

00:16:21.870 --> 00:16:23.540
Damn you, Wiseman...

00:16:23.540 --> 00:16:25.790
At this point, all I can do is 
finish this as soon as possible

00:16:25.790 --> 00:16:29.300
and reduce the strain on them.

00:16:31.050 --> 00:16:32.380
Sorry, Izzy.

00:16:33.260 --> 00:16:34.550
I was stupid.

00:16:35.050 --> 00:16:38.600
And BB, I betrayed you.

00:16:39.520 --> 00:16:41.060
But there's no doubt now.

00:16:41.770 --> 00:16:43.310
I will protect everyone!

00:16:44.480 --> 00:16:45.690
And Arya,

00:16:46.110 --> 00:16:47.820
that includes you!

00:17:20.140 --> 00:17:22.270
He's moving it with his own will now?

00:17:38.160 --> 00:17:40.780
<i>D-Don't worry, everyone.</i>

00:17:41.290 --> 00:17:43.200
<i>It will get better soon.</i>

00:17:44.040 --> 00:17:46.710
<i>Even if the strain of two sources</i>

00:17:47.120 --> 00:17:48.960
<i>materializing is divided among us all,</i>

00:17:49.420 --> 00:17:52.590
<i>if we don't choose one to 
bear it, we'll all fall.</i>

00:17:54.010 --> 00:17:57.010
<i>And I'm the eldest sister...</i>

00:17:58.050 --> 00:18:01.720
<i>So I have a duty to 
protect my younger sisters!</i>

00:18:03.810 --> 00:18:06.230
Huh? My headache...

00:18:15.780 --> 00:18:16.780
<i>Arya...</i>

00:18:18.860 --> 00:18:20.200
<i>That includes you, too.</i>

00:19:07.410 --> 00:19:09.670
They may be on even terms,

00:19:09.670 --> 00:19:12.420
but since the princess has no 
experience in martial arts,

00:19:12.420 --> 00:19:14.750
this is the one form she wouldn't 
want the fight to take.

00:19:15.250 --> 00:19:17.460
It's time to pay for always 
relying on her powers.

00:19:24.350 --> 00:19:27.060
You bastard... You bastard!

00:19:36.730 --> 00:19:39.450
There you are!

00:19:44.410 --> 00:19:46.620
Go!

00:19:46.620 --> 00:19:49.000
That's it, Seigi-kun!

00:19:49.000 --> 00:19:52.080
Wait, Tamaki-san, you're alive?! No way!

00:19:55.290 --> 00:19:57.170
Finish her, Seigi.

00:20:00.510 --> 00:20:01.840
You bastard!

00:20:07.640 --> 00:20:09.980
You'll regret this, boy!

00:20:09.980 --> 00:20:12.350
Don't think you've beaten me!

00:20:49.140 --> 00:20:51.770
He did it! Seigi-kun won!

00:20:51.770 --> 00:20:54.190
The princess ran off with 
her tail between her legs!

00:20:54.190 --> 00:20:55.520
All right!

00:20:56.060 --> 00:21:04.150
USA! USA! USA!

00:21:04.150 --> 00:21:06.950
Seigi-kun, I can't believe you...

00:21:07.280 --> 00:21:08.240
Yes!

00:21:08.240 --> 00:21:09.950
We won! We won!

00:21:12.500 --> 00:21:14.870
We were fortunate that the

00:21:14.870 --> 00:21:16.960
operation ended as I predicted.

00:21:17.750 --> 00:21:19.840
We're going to be busy for a while.

00:21:20.800 --> 00:21:24.170
Begin preparations to negotiate 
with America, everyone.

00:21:25.050 --> 00:21:26.970
I will hold the truth in my hands.

00:21:50.280 --> 00:21:51.290
I am who I am today

00:21:51.580 --> 00:21:55.040
because I took BB's hand that day.

00:21:55.710 --> 00:21:58.580
So now, I have a duty to inherit his beliefs

00:21:58.960 --> 00:22:02.000
and the hope that he kept 
alive for everyone.

00:22:02.590 --> 00:22:05.260
How could I have forgotten 
something so obvious?

00:22:15.850 --> 00:22:16.940
Thanks.

00:22:19.940 --> 00:22:23.280
I'd be completely useless on my own.

00:22:49.840 --> 00:22:52.600
My army is the strongest in the world!

00:22:59.100 --> 00:23:02.020
Let's settle everything here, 
at the South Pole!

00:23:06.650 --> 00:23:07.610
I'll become a god.

00:23:08.650 --> 00:23:10.910
I am number one!

00:23:13.200 --> 00:23:14.950
The time for the deciding battle has come.

00:23:25.170 --> 00:23:31.300
Clown!

00:23:35.720 --> 00:23:39.690
What do the remaining two think?
